{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_ecd1b7480d794aeb8db741ed","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"6:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3813\">\n    <frame id=\"6:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"6:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"6:5\" name=\"Meet — dating and social app\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"6:6\" name=\"Design Meet, a dating and social app: sign in, browse stories and posts on Explore, decide on suggested partners, visit a friend’s profile and watch a short, and manage your own profile from its menu. Canvas 393 × 852, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"6:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 8 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, backgrounds and surfaces including any tint or gradient, overlays on photos, online / active, like, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii, blur and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, the tabs, the sheet, the drawer and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, logo and icons from 04 · Media. Each person always uses their own portrait. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1545\">\n      <text id=\"6:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1456\">\n        <frame id=\"6:14\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"6:15\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"112\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:16\" name=\"Goal: Choose how to get started.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Continue with Facebook” (Icon_Facebook) · “Continue with Google” (Icon_Google) · “Use mobile number” · “Sign Up” • Copy: “Don’t have an account?” · headline “Let’s meet new people around you” • Media: Portrait_Sarah_Payne with a heart (Icon_Heart) · Portrait_Henry · Portrait_Lucie · Portrait_Marry · Portrait_Pierre\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:20\" name=\"→ Sign Up → 02_Apple_ID_Sheet\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:21\" name=\"02_Apple_ID_Sheet\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"6:22\" name=\"02_Apple_ID_Sheet\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"171\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:23\" name=\"Goal: Confirm signing in with an Apple ID.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:25\" name=\"• Actions: close (Icon_Close) · Face ID (Icon_Face_ID) • App: Logo_Meet • Copy: “Apple ID” · “Do you want to sign in to Meet Dating App: Meet People with your Apple ID “sarahp@example.com”?” · “Face ID” • Presentation: sheet over 01_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:27\" name=\"→ Face ID → 03_Explore → close → 01_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:28\" name=\"03_Explore\" x=\"0\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"6:29\" name=\"03_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:30\" name=\"Goal: Catch up on stories and posts from people.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:32\" name=\"• Actions: “Make Friends” · “Search Partners” • Feed: Noemi Slater · Yu Jian · Maddison Burke posts, each with portrait, name, photo and like (Icon_Like) / comment (Icon_Chat) / more (Icon_More) (see DATA) • Header: “Explore” · notifications (Icon_Bell) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Dating / Add / Chat / Profile · current: Home • Stories: “Your Story” with add (Icon_Plus) · Ben · Lucie · Marry · Claire · Lina · Jo · Henry · Pierre, each with portrait and first name\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"6:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:34\" name=\"→ Claire (story) → 05_Friend_Profile → Dating tab → 04_Find_Partner → Profile tab → 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:35\" name=\"04_Find_Partner\" x=\"668\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"6:36\" name=\"04_Find_Partner\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"147\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:37\" name=\"Goal: Decide on the next suggested partner.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:39\" name=\"• Actions: like (Icon_Heart) · pass (Icon_Close) · super like (Icon_Star) • Card stack: top card John, 27 · San Francisco (Icon_Location) · 20 km away · Active Now (Portrait_John); 5 more cards behind it (see DATA) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Find your partner” • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Dating\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:41\" name=\"→ back / Home tab → 03_Explore → Profile tab → 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:42\" name=\"05_Friend_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"740\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"6:43\" name=\"05_Friend_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"155\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:44\" name=\"Goal: See who Claire is and connect.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:46\" name=\"• Actions: “Follow” · “Message” • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Claire Smith” · more (Icon_More) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home • Media grid: Claire_01 – Claire_09 (01 and 09 are videos, Icon_Play) • Profile: Portrait_Claire_Smith · “63K Followers” • Tabs: Top · Recent · Short · current: Top\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"6:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:48\" name=\"→ back → 03_Explore → Short (tab) → 06_Short_Video\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:49\" name=\"06_Short_Video\" x=\"668\" y=\"740\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"6:50\" name=\"06_Short_Video\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:51\" name=\"Goal: Watch a short and react to it.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:53\" name=\"• Actions: like 123 (Icon_Heart) · comment 89 (Icon_Chat) · share (Icon_Send) · more (Icon_More) • Author: Portrait_Yu_Jian · “Yu Jian” · “Follow” • Caption: “I think I’m in love with you” · “Liked by Harrison Pearce and others” · music “Nothing Can Stop Me! · Jperriel” (Icon_Music) · “4 people” (Icon_Person) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Short” · camera (Icon_Camera) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home • Media: Short_Yu_Jian_Shore, full-screen video\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"6:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:55\" name=\"→ back → 05_Friend_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:56\" name=\"07_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"1120\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"6:57\" name=\"07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"86\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:58\" name=\"Goal: See and manage my own profile.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:60\" name=\"• Actions: “Edit Profile” · “Share Profile” • Header: menu (Icon_Menu) · “Sarah Payne” • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Profile • Media grid: Sarah_01 – Sarah_09 (01 is a video, Icon_Play) • Profile: Portrait_Sarah_Payne · “103K Followers” • Tabs: Top · Recent · Short · current: Top\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"6:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:62\" name=\"→ menu → 08_Menu → Home tab → 03_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:63\" name=\"08_Menu\" x=\"668\" y=\"1120\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"6:64\" name=\"08_Menu\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"83\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:65\" name=\"Goal: Reach account areas from the profile.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:67\" name=\"• Account: Portrait_Sarah_Payne · “Sarah Payne” · “Show Profile” · close (Icon_Close) • App: Logo_Meet • Menu: Archive · Close Friends · Discover people · Favorites · Group profiles · Saved · Setting · Your Activity, each with its icon and Icon_Chevron_Right (source order in DATA) • Presentation: drawer over 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:69\" name=\"→ close / Show Profile → 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:70\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"2147\" width=\"1312\" height=\"183\">\n      <text id=\"6:71\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:72\" name=\"• Sign-in flow: 01_Welcome → Sign Up → 02_Apple_ID_Sheet (sheet over 01) → Face ID → 03_Explore. • Bottom tab bar on 03–07 with 5 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Dating (Icon_Heart), Add (Icon_Plus), Chat (Icon_Chat), Profile (Portrait_Sarah_Payne). Current: Home on 03, 05 and 06; Dating on 04; Profile on 07. How the current tab looks is yours. • 05 and 06 are pushed from Explore (Claire’s story → her profile → its Short tab → the short). 08_Menu is a drawer over 07_Profile. • Entry only (no frame): Continue with Facebook / Google, Use mobile number, notifications, Make Friends, Search Partners, other stories, feed actions, Your Story, like / pass / super like, Follow, Message, more, Top / Recent tabs, grid items, short actions, camera, Edit Profile, Share Profile, menu rows, Add, Chat.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"132\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:73\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2378\" width=\"1312\" height=\"702\">\n      <text id=\"6:74\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:75\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:76\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"613\">\n        <frame id=\"6:77\" name=\"Me\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"6:78\" name=\"Me\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:79\" name=\"Sarah Payne · 103K Followers · Portrait_Sarah_Payne Apple ID: sarahp@example.com\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:80\" name=\"Stories (in this order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"6:81\" name=\"Stories (in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:82\" name=\"Your Story (Portrait_Sarah_Payne) · Ben · Lucie · Marry · Claire · Lina · Jo · Henry · Pierre (Portrait_&lt;name&gt;; Claire = Portrait_Claire_Smith)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:83\" name=\"Feed posts (portrait · photo)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"6:84\" name=\"Feed posts (portrait · photo)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"193\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:85\" name=\"Noemi Slater (Portrait_Noemi_Slater · Post_Noemi_Slater) Yu Jian (Portrait_Yu_Jian · Post_Yu_Jian) Maddison Burke (Portrait_Maddison_Burke · Post_Maddison_Burke)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:86\" name=\"Partner cards (top to bottom of the stack)\" x=\"0\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"277\">\n          <text id=\"6:87\" name=\"Partner cards (top to bottom of the stack)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"285\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:88\" name=\"John, 27 · San Francisco · 20 km away · Active Now (Portrait_John) Dan, 28 · Fremont · 12 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Dan) Aidan, 25 · San Ramon · 20 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Aidan) William, 24 · Stockton · 40 km away · Active Now (Portrait_William) Keven, 24 · Los Angeles · 560 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Keven) Kalvin, 23 · Los Angeles · 560 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Kalvin)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"209\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:89\" name=\"Friend profile\" x=\"444\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"6:90\" name=\"Friend profile\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:91\" name=\"Claire Smith · 63K Followers · Portrait_Claire_Smith Grid: Claire_01_Video_Ocean, Claire_02 – Claire_08, Claire_09_Video_Reef\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:92\" name=\"Short video\" x=\"888\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"6:93\" name=\"Short video\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:94\" name=\"Yu Jian · “I think I’m in love with you” Liked by Harrison Pearce and others Nothing Can Stop Me! · Jperriel · 4 people Likes 123 · Comments 89\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:95\" name=\"My profile grid\" x=\"0\" y=\"469\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"6:96\" name=\"My profile grid\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:97\" name=\"Sarah_01_Video_Wave, Sarah_02 – Sarah_09\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:98\" name=\"Menu (source order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"469\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"6:99\" name=\"Menu (source order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:100\" name=\"Setting (Icon_Settings) · Your Activity (Icon_Activity) · Archive (Icon_Archive) · Saved (Icon_Saved) · Close Friends (Icon_Close_Friends) · Favorites (Icon_Star) · Group profiles (Icon_Group) · Discover people (Icon_Discover)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:101\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3128\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"6:102\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:103\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"6:104\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"6:105\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"6:106\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand colors #4B164C + #DD88CF and Inter • Media: portraits, posts, profile grids, logo, icons • Default Button, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:107\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"6:108\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"6:109\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces (tints, gradients), overlays on photos, online / active, like, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, blur, elevation • All states: current tab, current profile tab, pressed, followed / liked, disabled • Headers, tab bar, tabs, story avatars, feed post, swipe card stack, action buttons, profile header, media grid, short-video overlay, sign-in sheet, drawer and menu rows • How photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:110\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3468\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"6:111\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:112\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"6:113\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, current profile tab, top card of the stack, sheet / drawer presentation)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"6:114\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 8 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e49f7b8d-beff-4d45-bc73-771a1107ac68","uuid":"2d3e8011-c491-44a6-a404-3e218789dca5","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:49:56.490Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"6:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3813\">\n    <frame id=\"6:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"6:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"6:5\" name=\"Meet — dating and social app\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"6:6\" name=\"Design Meet, a dating and social app: sign in, browse stories and posts on Explore, decide on suggested partners, visit a friend’s profile and watch a short, and manage your own profile from its menu. Canvas 393 × 852, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"249\">\n      <text id=\"6:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 8 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself (neutrals, text, backgrounds and surfaces including any tint or gradient, overlays on photos, online / active, like, error / disabled), plus type scale, spacing, radii, blur and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the tab bar, the tabs, the sheet, the drawer and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, logo and icons from 04 · Media. Each person always uses their own portrait. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"198\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"554\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1545\">\n      <text id=\"6:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1456\">\n        <frame id=\"6:14\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"6:15\" name=\"01_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"112\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:16\" name=\"Goal: Choose how to get started.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Continue with Facebook” (Icon_Facebook) · “Continue with Google” (Icon_Google) · “Use mobile number” · “Sign Up” • Copy: “Don’t have an account?” · headline “Let’s meet new people around you” • Media: Portrait_Sarah_Payne with a heart (Icon_Heart) · Portrait_Henry · Portrait_Lucie · Portrait_Marry · Portrait_Pierre\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:20\" name=\"→ Sign Up → 02_Apple_ID_Sheet\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:21\" name=\"02_Apple_ID_Sheet\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"6:22\" name=\"02_Apple_ID_Sheet\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"171\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:23\" name=\"Goal: Confirm signing in with an Apple ID.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:25\" name=\"• Actions: close (Icon_Close) · Face ID (Icon_Face_ID) • App: Logo_Meet • Copy: “Apple ID” · “Do you want to sign in to Meet Dating App: Meet People with your Apple ID “sarahp@example.com”?” · “Face ID” • Presentation: sheet over 01_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:27\" name=\"→ Face ID → 03_Explore → close → 01_Welcome\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:28\" name=\"03_Explore\" x=\"0\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"6:29\" name=\"03_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:30\" name=\"Goal: Catch up on stories and posts from people.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:32\" name=\"• Actions: “Make Friends” · “Search Partners” • Feed: Noemi Slater · Yu Jian · Maddison Burke posts, each with portrait, name, photo and like (Icon_Like) / comment (Icon_Chat) / more (Icon_More) (see DATA) • Header: “Explore” · notifications (Icon_Bell) • Main navigation: tab bar Home / Dating / Add / Chat / Profile · current: Home • Stories: “Your Story” with add (Icon_Plus) · Ben · Lucie · Marry · Claire · Lina · Jo · Henry · Pierre, each with portrait and first name\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"6:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:34\" name=\"→ Claire (story) → 05_Friend_Profile → Dating tab → 04_Find_Partner → Profile tab → 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:35\" name=\"04_Find_Partner\" x=\"668\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"6:36\" name=\"04_Find_Partner\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"147\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:37\" name=\"Goal: Decide on the next suggested partner.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:39\" name=\"• Actions: like (Icon_Heart) · pass (Icon_Close) · super like (Icon_Star) • Card stack: top card John, 27 · San Francisco (Icon_Location) · 20 km away · Active Now (Portrait_John); 5 more cards behind it (see DATA) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Find your partner” • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Dating\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:41\" name=\"→ back / Home tab → 03_Explore → Profile tab → 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:42\" name=\"05_Friend_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"740\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"6:43\" name=\"05_Friend_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"155\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:44\" name=\"Goal: See who Claire is and connect.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:46\" name=\"• Actions: “Follow” · “Message” • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Claire Smith” · more (Icon_More) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home • Media grid: Claire_01 – Claire_09 (01 and 09 are videos, Icon_Play) • Profile: Portrait_Claire_Smith · “63K Followers” • Tabs: Top · Recent · Short · current: Top\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"6:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:48\" name=\"→ back → 03_Explore → Short (tab) → 06_Short_Video\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:49\" name=\"06_Short_Video\" x=\"668\" y=\"740\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"6:50\" name=\"06_Short_Video\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:51\" name=\"Goal: Watch a short and react to it.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:53\" name=\"• Actions: like 123 (Icon_Heart) · comment 89 (Icon_Chat) · share (Icon_Send) · more (Icon_More) • Author: Portrait_Yu_Jian · “Yu Jian” · “Follow” • Caption: “I think I’m in love with you” · “Liked by Harrison Pearce and others” · music “Nothing Can Stop Me! · Jperriel” (Icon_Music) · “4 people” (Icon_Person) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Short” · camera (Icon_Camera) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home • Media: Short_Yu_Jian_Shore, full-screen video\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"6:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:55\" name=\"→ back → 05_Friend_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:56\" name=\"07_Profile\" x=\"0\" y=\"1120\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"6:57\" name=\"07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"86\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:58\" name=\"Goal: See and manage my own profile.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:60\" name=\"• Actions: “Edit Profile” · “Share Profile” • Header: menu (Icon_Menu) · “Sarah Payne” • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Profile • Media grid: Sarah_01 – Sarah_09 (01 is a video, Icon_Play) • Profile: Portrait_Sarah_Payne · “103K Followers” • Tabs: Top · Recent · Short · current: Top\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"6:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:62\" name=\"→ menu → 08_Menu → Home tab → 03_Explore\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:63\" name=\"08_Menu\" x=\"668\" y=\"1120\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"6:64\" name=\"08_Menu\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"83\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"6:65\" name=\"Goal: Reach account areas from the profile.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:66\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:67\" name=\"• Account: Portrait_Sarah_Payne · “Sarah Payne” · “Show Profile” · close (Icon_Close) • App: Logo_Meet • Menu: Archive · Close Friends · Discover people · Favorites · Group profiles · Saved · Setting · Your Activity, each with its icon and Icon_Chevron_Right (source order in DATA) • Presentation: drawer over 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"6:68\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"6:69\" name=\"→ close / Show Profile → 07_Profile\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:70\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"2147\" width=\"1312\" height=\"183\">\n      <text id=\"6:71\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:72\" name=\"• Sign-in flow: 01_Welcome → Sign Up → 02_Apple_ID_Sheet (sheet over 01) → Face ID → 03_Explore. • Bottom tab bar on 03–07 with 5 tabs in this order: Home (Icon_Home), Dating (Icon_Heart), Add (Icon_Plus), Chat (Icon_Chat), Profile (Portrait_Sarah_Payne). Current: Home on 03, 05 and 06; Dating on 04; Profile on 07. How the current tab looks is yours. • 05 and 06 are pushed from Explore (Claire’s story → her profile → its Short tab → the short). 08_Menu is a drawer over 07_Profile. • Entry only (no frame): Continue with Facebook / Google, Use mobile number, notifications, Make Friends, Search Partners, other stories, feed actions, Your Story, like / pass / super like, Follow, Message, more, Top / Recent tabs, grid items, short actions, camera, Edit Profile, Share Profile, menu rows, Add, Chat.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"132\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:73\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2378\" width=\"1312\" height=\"702\">\n      <text id=\"6:74\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:75\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:76\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"613\">\n        <frame id=\"6:77\" name=\"Me\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"6:78\" name=\"Me\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:79\" name=\"Sarah Payne · 103K Followers · Portrait_Sarah_Payne Apple ID: sarahp@example.com\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"38\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:80\" name=\"Stories (in this order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"6:81\" name=\"Stories (in this order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:82\" name=\"Your Story (Portrait_Sarah_Payne) · Ben · Lucie · Marry · Claire · Lina · Jo · Henry · Pierre (Portrait_&lt;name&gt;; Claire = Portrait_Claire_Smith)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:83\" name=\"Feed posts (portrait · photo)\" x=\"888\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"6:84\" name=\"Feed posts (portrait · photo)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"193\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:85\" name=\"Noemi Slater (Portrait_Noemi_Slater · Post_Noemi_Slater) Yu Jian (Portrait_Yu_Jian · Post_Yu_Jian) Maddison Burke (Portrait_Maddison_Burke · Post_Maddison_Burke)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:86\" name=\"Partner cards (top to bottom of the stack)\" x=\"0\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"277\">\n          <text id=\"6:87\" name=\"Partner cards (top to bottom of the stack)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"285\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:88\" name=\"John, 27 · San Francisco · 20 km away · Active Now (Portrait_John) Dan, 28 · Fremont · 12 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Dan) Aidan, 25 · San Ramon · 20 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Aidan) William, 24 · Stockton · 40 km away · Active Now (Portrait_William) Keven, 24 · Los Angeles · 560 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Keven) Kalvin, 23 · Los Angeles · 560 km away · Active Now (Portrait_Kalvin)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"209\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:89\" name=\"Friend profile\" x=\"444\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"125\">\n          <text id=\"6:90\" name=\"Friend profile\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:91\" name=\"Claire Smith · 63K Followers · Portrait_Claire_Smith Grid: Claire_01_Video_Ocean, Claire_02 – Claire_08, Claire_09_Video_Reef\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"57\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:92\" name=\"Short video\" x=\"888\" y=\"168\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"6:93\" name=\"Short video\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"80\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:94\" name=\"Yu Jian · “I think I’m in love with you” Liked by Harrison Pearce and others Nothing Can Stop Me! · Jperriel · 4 people Likes 123 · Comments 89\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:95\" name=\"My profile grid\" x=\"0\" y=\"469\" width=\"420\" height=\"87\">\n          <text id=\"6:96\" name=\"My profile grid\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:97\" name=\"Sarah_01_Video_Wave, Sarah_02 – Sarah_09\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"19\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:98\" name=\"Menu (source order)\" x=\"444\" y=\"469\" width=\"420\" height=\"144\">\n          <text id=\"6:99\" name=\"Menu (source order)\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"6:100\" name=\"Setting (Icon_Settings) · Your Activity (Icon_Activity) · Archive (Icon_Archive) · Saved (Icon_Saved) · Close Friends (Icon_Close_Friends) · Favorites (Icon_Star) · Group profiles (Icon_Group) · Discover people (Icon_Discover)\" x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"380\" height=\"76\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:101\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"64\" y=\"3128\" width=\"1312\" height=\"292\">\n      <text id=\"6:102\" name=\"What is fixed · what is yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"328\" height=\"35\" />\n      <frame id=\"6:103\" name=\"Fixed vs yours\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"241\">\n        <frame id=\"6:104\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"221\">\n          <text id=\"6:105\" name=\"Fixed (given)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"103\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"6:106\" name=\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand colors #4B164C + #DD88CF and Inter • Media: portraits, posts, profile grids, logo, icons • Default Button, platform shell\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"6:107\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"241\">\n          <text id=\"6:108\" name=\"Yours (designer decides)\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"197\" height=\"23\" />\n          <text id=\"6:109\" name=\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces (tints, gradients), overlays on photos, online / active, like, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, blur, elevation • All states: current tab, current profile tab, pressed, followed / liked, disabled • Headers, tab bar, tabs, story avatars, feed post, swipe card stack, action buttons, profile header, media grid, short-video overlay, sign-in sheet, drawer and menu rows • How photos are cropped and treated\" x=\"24\" y=\"57\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"6:110\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"64\" y=\"3468\" width=\"1312\" height=\"281\">\n      <text id=\"6:111\" name=\"How it is evaluated\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"222\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"6:112\" name=\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <text id=\"6:113\" name=\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, current profile tab, top card of the stack, sheet / drawer presentation)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"6:114\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 8 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"6a03cec5-340a-4609-a01d-573419f450a8"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_ecd1b7480d794aeb8db741ed","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
