Back), \"Find your partner\"\n   - Main navigation: tab bar, current: Dating\n   - LINKS: back / Home tab → 03_Explore; Profile tab → 07_Profile\n\n5. **05_Friend_Profile** — See who Claire is and connect.\n   - Actions: \"Follow\", \"Message\"\n   - Header: back (Icon_Back), \"Claire Smith\", more (Icon_More)\n   - Main navigation: tab bar, current: Home\n   - Media grid: Claire_01 – Claire_09 (01 and 09 are videos, Icon_Play)\n   - Profile: Portrait_Claire_Smith, \"63K Followers\"\n   - Tabs: Top, Recent, Short; current: Top\n   - LINKS: back → 03_Explore; Short (tab) → 06_Short_Video\n\n6. **06_Short_Video** — Watch a short and react.\n   - Actions: like 123 (Icon_Heart), comment 89 (Icon_Chat), share (Icon_Send), more (Icon_More)\n   - Author: Portrait_Yu_Jian, \"Yu Jian\", \"Follow\"\n   - Caption: \"I think I'm in love with you\", \"Liked by Harrison Pearce and others\", music \"Nothing Can Stop Me! · Jperriel\" (Icon_Music), \"4 people\" (Icon_Person)\n   - Header: back (Icon_Back), \"Short\", camera (Icon_Camera)\n   - Main navigation: tab bar, current: Home\n   - Media: Short_Yu_Jian_Shore, full-screen video\n   - LINKS: back → 05_Friend_Profile\n\n7. **07_Profile** — See and manage my own profile.\n   - Actions: \"Edit Profile\", \"Share Profile\"\n   - Header: menu (Icon_Menu), \"Sarah Payne\"\n   - Main navigation: tab bar, current: Profile\n   - Media grid: Sarah_01 – Sarah_09 (01 is a video, Icon_Play)\n   - Profile: Portrait_Sarah_Payne, \"103K Followers\"\n   - Tabs: Top, Recent, Short; current: Top\n   - LINKS: menu → 08_Menu; Home tab → 03_Explore\n\n8. **08_Menu** — Reach account areas from profile.\n   - Account: Portrait_Sarah_Payne, \"Sarah Payne\", \"Show Profile\", close (Icon_Close)\n   - App: Logo_Meet\n   - Menu: Archive, Close Friends, Discover people, Favorites, Group profiles, Saved, Setting, Your Activity, each with icon and Icon_Chevron_Right (source order in DATA: Setting (Icon_Settings) · Your Activity (Icon_Activity) · Archive (Icon_Archive) · Saved (Icon_Saved) · Close Friends (Icon_Close_Friends) · Favorites (Icon_Star) · Group profiles (Icon_Group) · Discover people (Icon_Discover))\n   - Presentation: drawer over 07_Profile\n   - LINKS: close / Show Profile → 07_Profile\n\n**Navigation structure**:\n- Sign-in flow: 01_Welcome → Sign Up → 02_Apple_ID_Sheet (sheet over 01) → Face ID → 03_Explore\n- Bottom tab bar on 03–07 with 5 tabs: Home (Icon_Home), Dating (Icon_Heart), Add (Icon_Plus), Chat (Icon_Chat), Profile (Portrait_Sarah_Payne). Current: Home on 03, 05, 06; Dating on 04; Profile on 07.\n- 05, 06 pushed from Explore. 08_Menu drawer over 07_Profile.\n\n**Fixed data**:\n- Me: Sarah Payne · 103K Followers · Portrait_Sarah_Payne · Apple ID: sarahp@example.com\n- Stories order: Your Story (Portrait_Sarah_Payne) · Ben · Lucie · Marry · Claire · Lina · Jo · Henry · Pierre (Portrait_<name>; Claire = Portrait_Claire_Smith)\n- Feed posts: Noemi Slater (Portrait_Noemi_Slater · Post_Noemi_Slater), Yu Jian (Portrait_Yu_Jian · Post_Yu_Jian), Maddison Burke (Portrait_Maddison_Burke · Post_Maddison_Burke)\n- Partner cards: John 27 SF 20km (Portrait_John), Dan 28 Fremont 12km (Portrait_Dan), Aidan 25 San Ramon 20km (Portrait_Aidan), William 24 Stockton 40km (Portrait_William), Keven 24 LA 560km (Portrait_Keven), Kalvin 23 LA 560km (Portrait_Kalvin)\n- Friend profile: Claire Smith · 63K Followers · Portrait_Claire_Smith; Grid: Claire_01_Video_Ocean, Claire_02–08, Claire_09_Video_Reef\n- Short video: Yu Jian · \"I think I'm in love with you\"; Liked by Harrison Pearce and others; Nothing Can Stop Me! · Jperriel · 4 people; Likes 123 · Comments 89\n- My profile grid: Sarah_01_Video_Wave, Sarah_02–09\n- Menu (source order): Setting (Icon_Settings) · Your Activity (Icon_Activity) · Archive (Icon_Archive) · Saved (Icon_Saved) · Close Friends (Icon_Close_Friends) · Favorites (Icon_Star) · Group profiles (Icon_Group) · Discover people (Icon_Discover)\n\n**Fixed**: Brand colors #4B164C + #DD88CF, Inter font