etPluginData/createImageAsync — noted.\n\nOne risk: `figma.currentPage = page` — banned; use await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page). Included in note. OK.\n\nText with mixed content — fine.\n\nLet me also confirm icon component names for lookup: I'll create a map ID→name and fetch via getNodeByIdAsync (IDs known from metadata) — more reliable than name search on media page:\n```js\nconst M = {Aidan:\"5:112\",Ben:\"5:139\",Claire:\"5:113\",Dan:\"5:114\",Henry:\"5:144\",Jo:\"5:141\",John:\"5:115\",Kalvin:\"5:116\",Keven:\"5:117\",Lina:\"5:118\",Lucie:\"5:142\",Maddison:\"5:119\",Marry:\"5:120\",Noemi:\"5:121\",Pierre:\"5:122\",Sarah:\"5:123\",William:\"5:124\",YuJian:\"5:125\",PostMaddison:\"5:126\",PostNoemi:\"5:127\",PostYuJian:\"5:128\",Short:\"5:137\",Logo:\"5:4\",\niActivity:\"5:85\",iArchive:\"5:88\",iBack:\"5:26\",iBell:\"5:33\",iCamera:\"5:58\",iChat:\"5:42\",iChevron:\"5:29\",iClose:\"5:23\",iCloseFriends:\"5:97\",iDiscover:\"5:105\",iFaceID:\"5:73\",iFacebook:\"5:14\",iGoogle:\"5:10\",iGroup:\"5:101\",iHeart:\"5:17\",iHome:\"5:36\",iLike:\"5:45\",iLocation:\"5:77\",iMenu:\"5:70\",iMore:\"5:48\",iMusic:\"5:63\",iPerson:\"5:67\",iPlay:\"5:51\",iPlus:\"5:39\",iSaved:\"5:91\",iSend:\"5:54\",iSettings:\"5:81\",iStar:\"5:20\",\nStatusBar:\"1:33\",HomeIndicator:\"1:44\",Button:\"1:28\"};\nconst Mcomp = {}; for(const k in M) Mcomp[k]=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(M[k]);\n```\nInclude this map in every call. \n\nNow — time to write Call 1. Keep code under 50k chars — plenty.\n\nAlso, one consideration: the section for components — sections API: figma.createSection(); available in plugin API (yes, since 2023). resizeWithoutConstraints on section? SectionNode has resizeWithoutConstraints? Section resize: section.resizeWithoutConstraints(w,h) — I believe yes. If error, catch and use resize.\n\nLet me write Call 1 now. I'll put components at section-relative coords. When appending to section, child x/y relative to section.\n\nPlan section 1500×2400: \nCol A x=40, Col B x=5