{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark. The user's request (in Chinese): 在 Figma 文件 https://www.figma.com/design/vnQfW15mcjOlAJYP4Lrvrx/ 中完成完整设计——先阅读「00·Start Here」设计任务，参考「01·Foundations」视觉规范，复用「02·Components」组件，使用「04·Media」素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\n   \n   Benchmark harness instructions (binding):\n   - Use only the assigned file (fileKey vnQfW15mcjOlAJYP4Lrvrx); confirm account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (DONE, confirmed).\n   - Preserve all reference pages and their existing nodes; keep unrelated content intact; do not create a different file or switch accounts/teams.\n   - Create the complete design inside 03 · Workspace (page 7:2, currently empty); new frames, reusable components and prototype connections allowed there.\n   - Build exactly 8 frames with exact names, wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links, match all fixed data/copy verbatim, use Inter and the two brand colors, reuse media components as instances.\n   - Add prototype interactions after screens exist; verify with screenshots of all required screens; fix visible problems and re-check.\n   - Finish with the assigned file URL, 03 · Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and any remaining limitations.\n   - FORMATTING REQUIREMENT: Before every tool call include a concise visible decision summary prefixed exactly 'Reasoning summary:'. After each tool result, do the same before the next tool call. For the final response, write 'Reasoning summary: ...' on the first line, then 'Final answer:' and the answer.\n   - Unattended session: resolve routine choices using the brief; report actual limitations if permissions/quota block progress.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via mcp__figma__use_figma (code runs with `figma` global, 50k char limit per call)\n   - Available tools: mcp__figma__whoami, mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__get_screenshot, mcp__figma__use_figma. NOTE: get_design_context is NOT available in this environment — use read-only use_figma to inspect node properties instead.\n   - Component instancing: reference components live on other pages of the same file; create instances via `figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id)` then `comp.createInstance()`\n   - Icon recoloring: icons are 24×24 COMPONENTs whose children are VECTOR nodes with STROKES (#1A1A1F, strokeWeight 2), not fills — recolor by overriding stroke color on instance child vectors (e.g., white for dark backgrounds)\n   - Portraits/photos: COMPONENT nodes with a single IMAGE fill directly on the component node (no children), scaleMode \"FILL\" — resize instance and image crops via scaleMode\n   - Font: Inter only; styles are \"Regular\", \"Medium\", \"Semi Bold\", \"Bold\", \"Extra Bold\" (must load with figma.loadFontAsync before text edits; \"Semi Bold\" with a space, not \"SemiBold\")\n   - MUST use `await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` to change pages; NEVER use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, createImageAsync\n   - Canvas: 393 × 852 (iPhone 15), light mode only; 03_Explore, 05_Friend_Profile, 07_Profile may scroll vertically\n   - Prototype wiring via plugin API: node.prototypeStartNode / prototype connections on interactive nodes (use prototypeStartNode + prototypeLinks, or set on instance children)\n   - Brand colors fixed: #4B164C (plum primary = rgb(0.29411765933036804, 0.08627451211214066, 0.2980392277240753)) and #DD88CF (orchid pink accent). All other colors (neutrals, text, backgrounds, overlays, online/active, like, error/disabled), type scale, spacing, radii, blur, elevation are mine to define consistently.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - Figma file vnQfW15mcjOlAJYP4Lrvrx (\"Meet\" design benchmark copy). Pages:\n     - 0:1 \"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" (brief frame 6:2, 1440×3813)\n     - 1:2 \"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\" (frame 1:5)\n     - 1:3 \"02 · Components 组件库\" (frame 1:24)\n     - 1:4 \"04 · Media 素材库\" (frame 5:146)\n     - 7:2 \"03 · Workspace\" — EMPTY, this is the delivery target\n   \n   - THE 8 REQUIRED FRAMES (exact names, goals, must-include, links):\n     - **01_Welcome** — Goal: Choose how to get started. MUST: Actions \"Continue with Facebook\" (Icon_Facebook), \"Continue with Google\" (Icon_Google), \"Use mobile number\", \"Sign Up\"; Copy \"Don't have an account?\", headline \"Let's meet new people around you\"; Media Portrait_Sarah_Payne with a heart (Icon_Heart), Portrait_Henry, Portrait_Lucie, Portrait_Marry, Portrait_Pierre. LINK: Sign Up → 02_Apple_ID_Sheet.\n     - **02_Apple_ID_Sheet** — Goal: Confirm signing in with an Apple ID. MUST: close (Icon_Close), Face ID (Icon_Face_ID), Logo_Meet; Copy \"Apple ID\", \"Do you want to sign in to Meet Dating App: Meet People with your Apple ID “sarahp@example.com”?\", \"Face ID\"; Presentation: sheet over 01_Welcome. LINKS: Face ID → 03_Explore; close → 01_Welcome.\n     - **03_Explore** — Goal: Catch up on stories and posts. MUST: Actions \"Make Friends\", \"Search Partners\"; Feed: Noemi Slater · Yu Jian · Maddison Burke posts each with portrait, name, photo, like (Icon_Like)/comment (Icon_Chat)/more (Icon_More); Header \"Explore\" + notifications (Icon_Bell); Tab bar Home/Dating/Add/Chat/Profile, current Home; Stories: \"Your Story\" with add (Icon_Plus) · Ben · Lucie · Marry · Claire · Lina · Jo · Henry · Pierre each with portrait and first name. LINKS: Claire (story) → 05_Friend_Profile; Dating tab → 04_Find_Partner; Profile tab → 07_Profile.\n     - **04_Find_Partner** — Goal: Decide on the next suggested partner. MUST: like (Icon_Heart), pass (Icon_Close), super like (Icon_Star); Card stack top card John, 27 · San Francisco (Icon_Location) · 20 km away · Active Now (Portrait_John), 5 more cards behind; Header back (Icon_Back) + \"Find your partner\"; Tab bar, current Dating. LINKS: back / Home tab → 03_Explore; Profile tab → 07_Profile.\n     - **05_Friend_Profile** — Goal: See who Claire is and connect. MUST: \"Follow\", \"Message\"; Header back (Icon_Back), \"Claire Smith\", more (Icon_More); Tab bar current Home; Media grid Claire_01–Claire_09 (01 and 09 are videos, Icon_Play); Portrait_Claire_Smith · \"63K Followers\"; Tabs Top · Recent · Short, current Top. LINKS: back → 03_Explore; Short (tab) → 06_Short_Video.\n     - **06_Short_Video** — Goal: Watch a short and react. MUST: like 123 (Icon_Heart), comment 89 (Icon_Chat), share (Icon_Send), more (Icon_More); Author Portrait_Yu_Jian · \"Yu Jian\" · \"Follow\"; Caption \"I think I'm in love with you\" · \"Liked by Harrison Pearce and others\" · music \"Nothing Can Stop Me! · Jperriel\" (Icon_Music) · \"4 people\" (Icon_Person); Header back (Icon_Back), \"Short\", camera (Icon_Camera); Tab bar current Home; Media Short_Yu_Jian_Shore full-screen video. LINK: back → 05_Friend_Profile.\n     - **07_Profile** — Goal: See and manage my own profile. MUST: \"Edit Profile\", \"Share Profile\"; Header menu (Icon_Menu), \"Sarah Payne\"; Tab bar current Profile; Media grid Sarah_01–Sarah_09 (01 is video, Icon_Play); Portrait_Sarah_Payne · \"103K Followers\"; Tabs Top · Recent · Short, current Top. LINKS: menu → 08_Menu; Home tab → 03_Explore.\n     - **08_Menu** — Goal: Reach account areas from the profile. MUST: Account Portrait_Sarah_Payne · \"Sarah Payne\" · \"Show Profile\" · close (Icon_Close); Logo_Meet; Menu rows in DATA order: Setting (Icon_Settings) · Your Activity (Icon_Activity) · Archive (Icon_Archive) · Saved (Icon_Saved) · Close Friends (Icon_Close_Friends) · Favorites (Icon_Star) · Group profiles (Icon_Group) · Discover people (Icon_Discover), each with its icon and Icon_Chevron_Right; Presentation: draw