nu source order: Setting (Icon_Settings) · Your Activity (Icon_Activity) · Archive (Icon_Archive) · Saved (Icon_Saved) · Close Friends (Icon_Close_Friends) · Favorites (Icon_Star) · Group profiles (Icon_Group) · Discover people (Icon_Discover)\n   \n   - MEDIA COMPONENT IDs (all COMPONENT nodes, instanced via createInstance):\n     - Portraits: Portrait_Aidan 5:112, Portrait_Ben 5:139, Portrait_Claire_Smith 5:113, Portrait_Dan 5:114, Portrait_Henry 5:144, Portrait_Jo 5:141, Portrait_John 5:115, Portrait_Kalvin 5:116, Portrait_Keven 5:117, Portrait_Lina 5:118, Portrait_Lucie 5:142, Portrait_Maddison_Burke 5:119, Portrait_Marry 5:120, Portrait_Noemi_Slater 5:121, Portrait_Pierre 5:122, Portrait_Sarah_Payne 5:123, Portrait_William 5:124, Portrait_Yu_Jian 5:125 (native sizes mostly 120×180; Ben/Henry/Maddison 270×180; John/Marry 180×180)\n     - Posts/short: Post_Maddison_Burke 5:126 (270×180), Post_Noemi_Slater 5:127 (263×180), Post_Yu_Jian 5:128 (269×180), Short_Yu_Jian_Shore 5:137 (320×180)\n     - Claire grid: Claire_01_Video_Ocean 5:111 (320×180), Claire_02 5:108, Claire_03 5:110, Claire_04 5:140, Claire_05 5:107, Claire_06 5:106, Claire_07 5:109 (all 120×180), Claire_08 5:138 (270×180), Claire_09_Video_Reef 5:143 (288×180)\n     - Sarah grid: Sarah_01_Video_Wave 5:129 (101×180), Sarah_02 5:130 (270×180), Sarah_03 5:131 (144×180), Sarah_04 5:132 (151×180), Sarah_05 5:133 (135×180), Sarah_06 5:134 (319×180), Sarah_07 5:135 (120×180), Sarah_08 5:136 (144×180), Sarah_09 5:145 (270×180)\n     - Logo: Logo_Meet 5:4 (34×35, plum vector fill)\n     - Icons (all 24×24): Icon_Activity 5:85, Icon_Archive 5:88, Icon_Back 5:26, Icon_Bell 5:33, Icon_Camera 5:58, Icon_Chat 5:42, Icon_Chevron_Right 5:29, Icon_Close 5:23, Icon_Close_Friends 5:97, Icon_Discover 5:105, Icon_Face_ID 5:73, Icon_Facebook 5:14 (keeps brand color), Icon_Google 5:10 (keeps brand color), Icon_Group 5:101, Icon_Heart 5:17, Icon_Home 5:36, Icon_Like 5:45, Icon_Location 5:77, Icon_Menu 5:70, Icon_More 5:48, Icon_Music 5:63, Icon_Person 5:67, Icon_Play 5:51, Icon_Plus 5:39, Icon_Saved 5:91, Icon_Send 5:54, Icon_Settings 5:81, Icon_Star 5:20\n   \n   - GIVEN COMPONENTS (02 · Components): Button 1:28 (COMPONENT 345×52, plum fill #4B164C, cornerRadius 26, child text \"Use mobile number\" Inter Semi Bold 16 white, centered); Status Bar 1:33 (COMPONENT 393×54, transparent fill, black glyphs: \"9:41\" Inter Semi Bold 17, Dynamic Island black rounded rect 125×37 r19, Signal frame, Wifi ellipse, Battery frame with black strokes); Home Indicator 1:44 (COMPONENT 393×34, transparent, child black rect 134×5 r3)\n   \n   - KEY STRUCTURAL FINDINGS from read-only inspection (use_figma describe() helper):\n     - Icon_Back (5:26): COMPONENT 24×24, fills=[] (invisible), child VECTOR \"Vector\" 7×14 at (8,5) with stroke #1A1A1F (rgb 0.102,0.102,0.122) strokeWeight 2, fills=[]\n     - Portrait_Aidan (5:112): COMPONENT 120×180 with single IMAGE fill directly on component (scaleMode \"FILL\", imageHash present), NO children\n     - Logo_Meet (5:4): COMPONENT 34×35, child VECTOR with plum SOLID fill\n     - Status bar glyphs are black — recolor overrides to white when placed over dark photos (e.g., 06_Short_Video, 02 sheet)\n   \n   - Read-only inspection code pattern used (keep for reuse):\n     ```javascript\n     function describe(n, d) { /* id,name,type,w,h,fills,strokes,strokeWeight,cornerRadius,TEXT fontName/fontSize/characters,children recursive */ }\n     const out = {};\n     out.button = describe(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(\"1:28\"), 0);\n     // ... etc\n     return JSON.stringify(out, null, 1);\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - Called get_metadata on nodes 1:28, 1:33, 5:112, 5:26 expecting detailed design context — got only shallow structure (types/positions). Tool results insisted \"you MUST call get_design_context\" but get_design_context is NOT in my available function set. Fix: switched to read-only mcp__figma__use_figma with a describe() helper to read fills/strokes/f