before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e49f7b8d-beff-4d45-bc73-771a1107ac68","uuid":"27d2a701-da72-4dec-9419-6f8d5c7a06fd","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:21:05.767Z","isSynthetic":true}
